    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6950" root="حبق" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَا حَبَاقِ</span></b>  is said to a female slave, [in reviling
her, meaning <i>O thou stinking one !</i>] (K,) like as
one says to her <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَا دَفَارِ</span>. (TA.)

